 "text": "Hey there, how are you holding up? Everyone can draw, it's just a matter of practicing regularly. Would you like me to find a basic drawing tutorial online, or are you hoping for a more in depth lesson? Let' start with a basic tutorial online. Lots of great ones on YouTube. A full lesson involves one on one time with teacher, often with tools in your hand. It' great way to pick up a career skill, but it's also very expensive. Then congrats, you've got years of practice behind you. Start each drawing by roughing in the basic shapes, then build up the details. Says someone who draws every day.",
